																		SCP Idea: Elaine of Astolat&#039;s Curse
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/arthcymro" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6987841); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6987841&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607286876" alt="arthcymro" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6987841)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/arthcymro" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6987841); return false;" >arthcymro</a></span> <span class="odate time_1604839081 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">08 Nov 2020 12:38</span>
														</div>
