<p>[Non-B Squad]</p>
<p>The SCP has three basic problems:<br />
1) That the mirror feeds on vanity and then casts it back as insults is interesting, but needs to be developed a little more, possibly by at least suggesting what would happen if the SCP didn't look at a reflective surface. After all, she has to sleep sometime&#8230;.</p>
