<p>Do you mean my own or SCP-4205?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>there's not really any kind of narrative stakes or anything pulling the story forward;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'd argue that what I said in my 3rd reply to Nagiros is a pretty high stake:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>What I'm planning in the climax is made the dramatic ending you'd like. The coating on SCP-XXXX's eyelids is also decaying, all be it slower than regular reflective surfaces but still at a measurable rate. This means that at some point, SCP-XXXX's coating will stop working.</p>
